 "lines": [
  {
   "line": 1,
   "text": "在東京鐵塔 第一次眺望",
   "lrc": 18.16,
   "pitchOnset": 18.288,
   "offset": 0.128,
   "pitchEnd": 24.055,
   "nextLrc": 26.77
  },
  {
   "line": 2,
   "text": "看燈火模仿 墜落的星光",
   "lrc": 26.77,
   "pitchOnset": 26.879,
   "offset": 0.109,
   "pitchEnd": 35.27,
   "nextLrc": 35.27
  },
  {
   "line": 3,
   "text": "我終於到達 但卻更悲傷",
   "lrc": 35.27,
   "pitchOnset": 34.901,
   "offset": -0.369,
   "pitchEnd": 40.927,
   "nextLrc": 43.88
  },
  {
   "line": 4,
   "text": "一個人完成 我們的夢想",
   "lrc": 43.88,
   "pitchOnset": 44.289,
   "offset": 0.409,
   "pitchEnd": 50.366,
   "nextLrc": 50.56
  },
  {
   "line": 5,
   "text": "你總說 時間還很多 你可以等我",
   "lrc": 50.56,
   "pitchOnset": 50.116,
   "offset": -0.444,
   "pitchEnd": 58.717,
   "nextLrc": 59.17
  },
  {
   "line": 6,
   "text": "以前我不懂得 未必明天 就有以後",
   "lrc": 59.17,
   "pitchOnset": 59.325,
   "offset": 0.155,
   "pitchEnd": 66.409,
   "nextLrc": 67.58
  },
  {
   "line": 7,
   "text": "想念是會呼吸的痛",
   "lrc": 67.58,
   "pitchOnset": 67.786,
   "offset": 0.206,
   "pitchEnd": 70.46,
   "nextLrc": 71.73
  },
  {
   "line": 8,
   "text": "它活在我身上所有角落",
   "lrc": 71.73,
   "pitchOnset": 74.59,
   "offset": 2.86,
   "pitchEnd": 74.98,
   "nextLrc": 76.31
  },
  {
   "line": 9,
   "text": "哼你愛的歌會痛 看你的信會痛",
   "lrc": 76.31,
   "pitchOnset": null,
   "offset": null,
   "pitchEnd": null,
   "nextLrc": 81.38
  },
  {
   "line": 10,
   "text": "連沉默也痛",
   "lrc": 81.38,
   "pitchOnset": null,
   "offset": null,
   "pitchEnd": null,
   "nextLrc": 84.85
  },
  {
   "line": 11,
   "text": "遺憾是會呼吸的痛",
   "lrc": 84.85,
   "pitchOnset": null,
   "offset": null,
   "pitchEnd": null,
   "nextLrc": 88.87
  },
  {
   "line": 12,
   "text": "它流在血液中來回滾動",
   "lrc": 88.87,
   "pitchOnset": 91.143,
   "offset": 2.273,
   "pitchEnd": 91.702,
   "nextLrc": 93.38
  },
  {
   "line": 13,
   "text": "後悔不貼心會痛 恨不懂你會痛",
   "lrc": 93.38,
   "pitchOnset": null,
   "offset": null,
   "pitchEnd": null,
   "nextLrc": 98.44
  },
  {
   "line": 14,
   "text": "想見不能見最痛",
   "lrc": 98.44,
   "pitchOnset": 98.945,
   "offset": 0.505,
   "pitchEnd": 121.873,
   "nextLrc": 123.18
  },
  {
   "line": 15,
   "text": "沒看你臉上 張揚過哀傷",
   "lrc": 123.18,
   "pitchOnset": 123.41,
   "offset": 0.23,
   "pitchEnd": 128.877,
   "nextLrc": 131.74
  },
  {
   "line": 16,
   "text": "那是種多麼 寂寞的倔強",
   "lrc": 131.74,
   "pitchOnset": 132.18,
   "offset": 0.44,
   "pitchEnd": 137.438,
   "nextLrc": 140.24
  },
  {
   "line": 17,
   "text": "你拆了城牆 讓我去流浪",
   "lrc": 140.24,
   "pitchOnset": 144.482,
   "offset": 4.242,
   "pitchEnd": 145.439,
   "nextLrc": 148.88
  },
  {
   "line": 18,
   "text": "在原地等我 把自己綑綁",
   "lrc": 148.88,
   "pitchOnset": 149.091,
   "offset": 0.211,
   "pitchEnd": 154.329,
   "nextLrc": 155.54
  },
  {
